	Section:
		Text: Barcodes
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Readable text
		Paragraph: With `Readable text: true` the data goes as text under the bars, in the font, size and color of the `Typography` of the `Barcode`. An EAN-13 sets its digits as on a product, the others write one centered line. The text adds its height to the code.
